Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 14:01:47 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1116/1179] Takes dragged onto a workspace (1159); Regenerate
 with a new seed (1160): a card dragged onto a workspace on the left moves
 there (the checked ones with it; Ctrl adds instead), asked first, Ctrl+Z
 gives it back; the card not draggable while its title is typed; the sheet
 says the shofar's adapter plays it at epoch 110; in the take's menu above the
 Writer, Regenerate with a new seed (every checked take on a checked card):
 the lab makes it again and swaps the new one into the old one's places

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 tools/console/app.css               |  7 ++++
 tools/console/app.js                | 20 ++++++++++
 tools/console/heresy-collection.js  | 59 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 tools/console/heresy-instruments.js |  2 +-
 4 files changed, 86 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

